<title>SPAIN: EIB to lend 82 mln ecu to Gaza, Jordan, Lebanon.</title>
<headline>EIB to lend 82 mln ecu to Gaza, Jordan, Lebanon.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Investment Bank (EIB) decided to lend a total of 82 million Ecu to Palestinian Gaza, Jordan and Lebanon for a range of infrastructural projects, EIB officials announced on Friday.</p>
<p>Lebanon will receive a 50 million ecu loan for projects aimed at reducing water pollution in coastal towns.</p>
<p>A 23 million ecu facility is directed at the Palestinian Authority for financing the first phase of contructing a harbour in Gaza.</p>
<p>The third loan, worth nine million ecu, was awarded to Jordan for restructuring and rehabilitation of the water distribution network.</p>
<p>The deal was announced at the end of a two-day EIB's forum on European Union's Mediterranean policy.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
